[Unit]
Description=Avocado demo VMs (latency-isolated cores)
Before=slices.target

[Slice]
# No AllowedCPUs here on purpose. Which cores the VMs get is the one thing in
# this demo that is a property of the board, not of the demo: on QCS6490 it is
# a big/little split (Kryo 670: A78 + A55), so the guests belong on the big
# cluster while housekeeping stays on the little one. The set is supplied by
# the vmm-cpus extension from cpus/<target>/, and every value there is measured
# on that board -- see the drop-in for the numbers.
